<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan overnights stay high in cash-short market.</title>
<headline>Pakistan overnights stay high in cash-short market.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-06-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan overnight rates remained high on Saturday in a tight market, dealers said.</p>
<p>Most trades took place at 18.50 to 20 percent, a dealer at Khadim Ali Shah Bukhari and Co Ltd said.</p>
<p>&quot;Term rates registered no change and remained inactive as borrowers saw the market being liquid over Monday, but we feel the prevailing dry conditions might continue in the coming week,&quot; the dealer said.</p>
<p>-- Ibrahim Khan 9221-5685192</p>
</text>
